         Copyright (c) 2009-2026, NVIDIA Corporation. All rights reserved.

The cudaraster subtree is a port of NVIDIA Research's HPG-2011 CUDA
Rasterizer (Laine & Karras). It is NVIDIA-authored and is redistributed
under the 3-clause BSD license carried in
integrations_v2/omnidreams/impl/ludus-renderer/ludus_renderer/_cpp/cudaraster/LICENSE,
with the following file-specific terms:
  CudaRasterKernels.cu: Apache-2.0 (local integration code).
  cudaraster_fw_stub.cpp: Apache-2.0 AND BSD-3-Clause (Apache port additions
  and retained BSD framework portions). Original BSD notices are preserved.

The tile-level rasterization
pipeline (triangle setup, bin / coarse / fine raster) is upstream code;
the host wrapper, viewport / multi-image plumbing, and deterministic
tiebreaker are local modifications. See
integrations_v2/omnidreams/impl/ludus-renderer/ludus_renderer/_cpp/cudaraster/PORT_NOTES.md
for the full list of deviations.

